\]  
Calculating:  
\[
v_2 = \frac{90.0}{5.97 \times 10^{24}} \text{ m/s} \approx 1.51 \times 10^{-23} \text{ m/s}
\]  

The approximate recoil velocity of the Earth is \(\boxed{1.51 \times 10^{-23} \text{ m/s}}\).
